  "_about": "Schloss Drachenburg: buff sandstone walls with a red course now and then, every dressing -- gables, pinnacles, the tympana under them, the turrets' caps of stone -- in a rose-red sandstone, the mouldings buff, pale silvery slate in diamond patterns on every roof and cone, iron cresting along the ridges and round the flat tops, the terrace and the bastion in yellow ashlar, lawns in gravel round a fountain; leaded glass, roses and the Kunsthalle's windows in colour.",
